      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūtungwa myaka shihūmbī (1,000)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūmona malaika alika kūfuma ng'wigūlū; ū mu nkono gwakwe walī na lūfungūlo lwa h'ishimayenze na nyololo ntaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlīdima ī Līshing'weng'we, ī Liyoka lya kale, ī Lyanishi na Līshetani; ūlītunga ikanza lya myaka 1,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlīponeja ng'wishimayenze ūlīlugalīla ng'wenūmo ūkanda na kūkanda a ha nyango, lītizikala lyūlembagūla banhū, kūshisha īshile ī myaka īyo 1,000; alīyo ūlū yūbīta ī mihayo yenīyo shiigelile lītaligūlīlwe kakanza kado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla hangī nabona masumbī g'ikūjo ga kwigasīja abo baalī binhwa būlamuji; nūjibona nīng'holò ja banhū abo baalī babūlagwa kūlwa nguno ya būkaanīji bo ng'wa Yesu, na kūlwa nguno ya mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu. Na a babo baalī batīlamije ī shiinū nūūlū ī shiikolile shayo, abo batanukūlile lūmeng'ho lwayo kū būshū nūūlū kū nkono gwabo. Bakabiza bapanga, būsuga hamò nang'hwe ū Kilisito ikanza lya myaka 1,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bafu a bangī batapīlile kūshisha īkalīke ī myaka īyo 1,000; ū wenūbū hū būjūūko bo kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balī na lubango, na balī beela abo bakūbiza na ngabo ū mu būjūūko bo kwandya. Ī licha lya kabīlī lītī na nguzu ū kūbo; bakūbiza bagabīji ba ng'wa Mulungu na ba ng'wa Kilisito, bakūsuga nang'hwe ikanza lya myaka 1,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpyenwa kwa ng'wa Shetani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī myaka 1,000 ūlū yūshila, ū Shetani akūlugūlīlwa ū mu shifungo shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūfuma moi akwandya kūgayeelela pye a mapandī ga mu sī, Gogi na Magogi; aje alīgalemba lemba a mahanga gīkī bibilinge kū būlūgū. Ū wingī wabo būlī gītī maseni ga ha nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaja hose hose ū mu sī, bahayūshika ha ng'hambī ya beela, a ha nzengo ntogwa, būgūgobanīja; alīyo gwika moto kūfuma ng'wigūlū gwiza gūbalya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū ng'wanishi ūyo wabalemba lembaga ūponyiwa mu nyanza ya moto gwa kūbaka na būgota bo shibiliti; h'ūmo yalī nī shiinū hamò nū ng'hangi ū nomolomo. Bakūbiza ng'wenūmo bakūluha luhiagwa līīmi na būjikū shiku jose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlamulwa kū būtongi wī Isumbi Lyape",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma hangī nūbona Isumbī lya būtemi lyape itaale; ī sī nī ligūlū shūpeela kwīnga ū kū būtongi bokwe ūyo walī aligasīgije, lītabonilwe hangī ī lipandī lyasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nūbabona a bafu, bataale na bado bīmīīlaga ū kū būtongi wī Isumbi lya būtemi, na mashitabo gūkundūlwa; na līshitabo līngī lyūkundūlwa, ī lya būpanga. A bafu būūlamulwa kūlwa kūlolwa īyo yalī yandīkilwe ū mu mashitabo genayo, kūlenganīla nū mumo yalī ī milīmo yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyanza yūbafunya a bafu abo baalī muyo, nū kūcha pyī nū kūlimu shūbafunya a bafu abo baalī musho. Būūlamulwa būlī ng'wene kūlenganīla na shītwa shakwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūcha nū kūlimu shūponyiwa mu nyanza ya moto; ī lyenīlo icha lya kabīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ose ose ūyo alaatandikilwe ū mu shitabo sha būpanga akaponyiwa mu nyanza ya moto!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
